  "readmeExcerpt": "# @freighttech/ui 🎨\n\nComposable UI toolkit for Open Mercato backoffice and business apps, maintained\nby [FreightTech.org](https://freighttech.org).\n\n`@freighttech/ui` includes backend UI patterns (DynamicTable, forms, dialogs,\ndetail sections, injections, notifications) and reusable primitives, built on\ntop of the Open Mercato framework.\n\n## Why this package ✨\n\n- 🧭 Consistent backoffice UX patterns out of the box\n- 🧩 Rich primitives + higher-level business components\n- ⚙️ Works with the Open Mercato injection architecture\n- 🚀 Speeds up delivery without sacrificing flexibility\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nyarn add @freighttech/ui\n```\n\n## Learn more\n\n- GitHub (repo): https://github.com/FreightTech/open-mercato-modules\n- Open Mercato framework: https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato\n- FreightTech.org: https://freighttech.org\n\n## License\n\nMIT. See [LICENSE](LICENSE) for details.\n",
